House Price India Exploratory Data Analysis

This is an exploratory data analysis (EDA) of the House Price India dataset, featuring univariate analysis, bivariate analysis, and business insights extracted using Pandas.

📊 Project Summary- 

I explored real estate datasets of houses in India to examine:

The distribution of individual variables (Univariate Analysis) such as the price of a house, its bedrooms, and skewness;
Correlation between variables (Bivariate Analysis) such as area and price, number of floors, presence of a waterfront, and location;
Business insights that come out of this analysis.
